OL,3,GNEWSA'Self-proclaimed misogynist' posed
OL,4,A'risk' to women
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with a history of unprovoked
OL,7,Fviolence towards women who was
OL,8,Fdescribed in court as a
OL,9,F"self-proclaimed misogynist" has been
OL,10,Fgiven a sexual harm prevention order.
OL,12,FGloucestershire Constabulary said
OL,13,FVictor Valentine, from the St Paul's
OL,14,Farea of Cheltenham, posed a risk to
OL,15,Fwomen in the town and the order was a
OL,16,F"preventative measure".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
