OL,3,GNEWSA'Self-proclaimed misogynist' posed
OL,4,A'risk' to women
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt bans the 29-year-old from using any
OL,7,Fdevice with access to the internet
OL,8,Funless he notifies police and also
OL,9,Fprevents him entering or loitering near
OL,10,Ffemale public toilets or changing
OL,11,Frooms.
OL,13,FAs well as a history of violence,
OL,14,FGloucestershire Police said Valentine
OL,15,Fhad persistently breached civil orders
OL,16,Fplaced on him. He has not been
OL,17,Fconvicted of any sexual offences.
